  speakerOverride: 
  text: 'On Quest 3: Grip grabs, Trigger selects UI, Left Thumbstick teleports, and Left Y summons or dismisses your floating Lab Tablet. On Desktop Simulator: W/A/S/D moves, Right-Drag looks, I teleports, G grabs, T/Click selects UI, and F (or Shift+2) toggles the Lab Tablet.'
